### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Get an user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/users/1

### Create user with bad parameters
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane",
  "email": "janedoe@example.com"
}

### Create user
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "janedoe@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}

